#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:5 e49560f9602840ec9da53f10e9c9ec4b
msgid "QuikTune"
msgstr "QuikTune"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:10 69fd750c0bfd4ff5ab700bdb3a09f8f3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `Rover QuikTune "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/rover-quicktune.md>`__ Lua script simplifies the process of finding good"
" gains for a vehicle's steering and speed controllers."
msgstr ""
"`Rover QuikTune "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/rover-quicktune.md>`__ Lua 脚本简化了为车辆转向和速度控制器寻找合适增益的过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:12 daf00e92b0f14cf683578831e4f5ae27
msgid ""
"The script should be run while the vehicle is circling in :ref:`Circle "
"mode <circle-mode>`. It records the steering and throttle outputs and the"
" resulting response (e.g. vehicle's turn rate and speed) for at least 10 "
"seconds in order to calculate the feed-forward gains. The P and I gains "
"are then set to a ratio of the feed-forward's. Once complete the gains "
"are saved automatically."
msgstr ""
"该脚本应在车辆以 :ref:`Circle 模式 <circle-mode>` "
"绕圈行驶时运行。脚本记录转向和油门输出及其对应的响应（如车辆的转弯速率和速度），时长至少 10 秒，以计算前馈增益。P 和 I "
"增益随后被设置为前馈增益的比例值。完成后增益将自动保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:17 dc0b7466d50e4480bd1368617b681e3d
msgid "By default the gains will be tuned in this order:"
msgstr "默认情况下，增益将按以下顺序进行调整："

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:19 e2e86b9db6c349828679dd4d61ceef4f
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`, then :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_P "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_P>` and I are set to ratios of the FF"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`，然后 :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_P "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_P>` 和 I 被设置为 FF 的比例值"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:20 a49a3888c17d477f833a20588f6ae9e7
msgid ""
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` and :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>`, then :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>` and I are set "
"to ratios of the FF"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>`，然后 :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>` 和 I 被设置为 FF 的比例值"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:22 7a5a821f2f9f45a8aa94870f5d017a6a
msgid "The script will also adjust filter settings:"
msgstr "脚本还将调整滤波器设置："

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:24 551a901ed6fb4bf9adbe78e8c79d6646
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD <ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD>` and FLTT will be set to half "
"of the :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER <INS_GYRO_FILTER>` value"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD <ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD>` 和 FLTT 将被设置为 "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER <INS_GYRO_FILTER>` 值的一半"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:27 5305a08c87fe4a8887c1e2f551fd241d
msgid "Installing the Script"
msgstr "安装脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:29 b91578b87736495dbd5d9fd9e97de16e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable scripting and then "
"reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用脚本功能，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:30 c1b8f5a09fa1499790efee1de2fbbffd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Download `rover-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/rover-quicktune.lua>`__ to your PC"
msgstr ""
"将 `rover-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/rover-quicktune.lua>`__ 下载到您的电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:31 924db6499f764d0c898fa6ffab0864ce
msgid ""
"Copy the script to your autopilot's SD card's APM/scripts directory.  If "
"using MP it may be easiest to use the Config, MAVFtp screen"
msgstr "将脚本复制到飞控 SD 卡的 APM/scripts 目录。如果使用 MP，可以通过 Config、MAVFtp 界面操作，较为方便"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:37 bcef1b9539e64088a03c74cb52a425c2
msgid "Reboot the autopilot and set RTUN_ENABLE = 1"
msgstr "重启飞控，并将 RTUN_ENABLE 设为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:38 6386644014634d4e93991281e5fe449e
msgid ""
"If an RC switch will be used to start/stop the tune set RCx_OPTION = 300 "
"where \"x\" is the RC input channel number.  Alternatively set one of "
"Mission Planner's Aux Function tab's rows to \"Scripting1\""
msgstr ""
"若要使用遥控开关来启动/停止调参，请将 RCx_OPTION = 300（其中 「x」 为 RC 输入通道编号）。也可在 Mission "
"Planner 的 Aux Function 选项卡中将某行设为 「Scripting1」"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:45 41ef787a310046dab9dc4b0d64022446
msgid "Running QuikTune"
msgstr "运行 QuikTune"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:47 c4f299bee6244ae998f96da5af1df6be
msgid "Go to an open area with good GPS reception"
msgstr "前往 GPS 信号良好的开阔区域"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:48 50dd87269fc64012a4cf7de1fd1aba4a
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station (e.g Mission Planner or QGC) and ensure "
"that the Messages tab can be seen.  This is where output from the tune "
"will appear"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner 或QGroundControl）连接飞行器，并确保能看到消息标签页。调参过程中的输出信息将显示在此处"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:49 59d93fb1774346be92a35ae972b84b07
msgid ""
"Move the RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's "
"\"Low\" button"
msgstr "将 RC 开关拨到低位，或按下 Mission Planner 辅助功能中的「Low」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:50 80553623b8b64cdaad83f3c42b1f9112
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`CIRC_SPEED <CIRC_SPEED>` to about half the vehicle's"
" maximum speed"
msgstr "可选：将 :ref:`CIRC_SPEED <CIRC_SPEED>` 设为车辆最大速度的大约一半"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:51 ee4208d856ee4ea599d22221c1c66576
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle, drive to an open area and switch to :ref:`Circle mode "
"<circle-mode>`"
msgstr "解锁车辆，驾驶到开阔区域并切换到 :ref:`圆形模式 <circle-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:52 0742f6796e8c4d768588a71689eba621
msgid ""
"Begin the tune by moving the RC switch to the middle position OR push "
"MP's Aux Function's \"Mid\" button"
msgstr "将遥控开关拨到中位，或按下 MP Aux Function 的 「Mid」 按钮以开始调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:53 038b0f8b005e4680ba6a6bb07b84f65b
msgid "Monitor the progress of the tune using the GCS's Messages tab"
msgstr "通过地面站的消息标签页监控调参进度"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:54 b8d572eaddf9489a96b47d92ad88d0a5
msgid ""
"If the RC steering and throttle sticks are moved from their center "
"position the tuning will be paused until a few seconds after they are "
"moved back to their center position"
msgstr "若 RC 转向和油门摇杆偏离中位，调参将暂停，直至摇杆回到中位几秒后才会继续"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:55 f14c291ad0204113929825ffacc9ddb8
msgid ""
"If the vehicle begins oscillating violently cancel the tune by moving the"
" RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"Low\" button"
msgstr "若车辆开始剧烈振荡，请将遥控开关拨回低位，或按下 MP Aux Function 的 「Low」 按钮以取消调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:56 2caec265cee84ab5b58176ec414cf3b7
msgid "Once the tune has completed the new gains will be saved automatically"
msgstr "调参完成后，新的增益值将自动保存"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:57 cfb6bc8646c8430fb6961d75097475e1
msgid "Drive the vehicle home and disarm"
msgstr "将车辆驾驶回起点并加锁"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:60 1fe936d8a59b40f9804bb9c407063169
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:62 a075d8fd5c694e62a8252119dfd8babe
msgid ""
"The full list of available `parameter settings are here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/rover-quicktune.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"完整的可用 `参数设置列表见此 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/rover-quicktune.md>`__"

